{"id":"agdas","qid":"Q1983932","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Ağdaş","ru":"Агдаш","en":"Agdash"},"coordinates":[47.48333,40.65],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"merkezi-aran","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q275784","az":"Ağdaş rayonu","en":"Aghdash District"}],"firstRecord":{"year":1501,"precision":"century","century":16,"bce":false,"kind":"earliest-record","source":"wd"},"period":"early-modern","forms":[{"form":"Учковах","lang":"ru","sources":["wp-ru"]}],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Ağdaş — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Ağdaş rayonunun Ağdaş şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər, Ağdaş rayonunun inzibati mərkəzi. XVI əsrdən şəhərdir. 19-cu əsrin əvvəllərində \"Üçqovaq\" adlanırdı.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Агда́ш (азерб. Ağdaş) — город и административный центр одноимённого района в центральной части Азербайджана. Расположен на Ширванской равнине, в 10 км к северо-востоку от железнодорожной станции Ляки на шоссе Тбилиси — Баку.\nАгдаш находится в центральной части Азербайджана, примерно в 250 км к западу от Баку. Город расположен на равнинной местности, рядом с рекой Турянчай. Географически он находится на пересечении важных транспортных путей, что делает его значимым для сельского хозяйства и торговли в регионе.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Agdash (Azerbaijani: Ağdaş), known as Arash (Ərəş) until 1919, is a city in and the capital of the Agdash District of Azerbaijan. Agdash suffered considerable damage during the June 4, 1999 earthquake but has since been thoroughly repaired.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1983932: Agdash","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1983932","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Ağdaş","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=A%C4%9Fda%C5%9F&oldid=9108051","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/A%C4%9Fda%C5%9F","revid":9108051,"revDate":"2026-09-15","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Агдаш","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%90%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%88&oldid=147488808","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%88","revid":147488808,"revDate":"2025-08-13","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Agdash, Azerbaijan","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Agdash%2C_Azerbaijan&oldid=1374571867","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agdash%2C_Azerbaijan","revid":1374571867,"revDate":"2026-09-12","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}